EB Garamond 12
  crates/neuma/fonts/eb-garamond-12.bin holds glyph advances and kerning
  measured from the EB Garamond 12 fonts, which are licensed under the SIL Open
  Font License 1.1. The table contains no outlines.
  crates/neuma/fonts/eb-garamond-google.bin holds the same measurements of
  the EB Garamond fonts served by Google Fonts (version 33, regular and italic),
  also under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, with no outlines.

