jgabc
  The psalm tone formulas in crates/neuma-tones/tones/solesmes.tones are
  transcribed from the tone table of jgabc by Benjamin Bloomfield, which is
  dedicated to the public domain (the Unlicense). https://github.com/bbloomf/jgabc

CMU Pronouncing Dictionary
  crates/neuma-tones/tones/stress.txt holds the lexical stress of words in the
  Office texts and the Coverdale psalter, taken from the CMU Pronouncing
  Dictionary. https://github.com/cmusphinx/cmudict

